{"3206660":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Storage Anomaly","steam_appid":3206660,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storage Anomaly is a first-person observation game. You work the night shift, alone, in a store's stockroom. Something has changed. It's up to you to find it.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spot what's off<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/cf1e8a3cba03bf9ba03163286cf17376.poster.avif?t=1793647947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/cf1e8a3cba03bf9ba03163286cf17376.webm?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shelf moved, one box too many, a door that wasn't there before. The further you go, the stranger the stockroom gets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look closely, take a photo<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/48e770957f7e4084e501f8b3a4819d09.poster.avif?t=1793647947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/48e770957f7e4084e501f8b3a4819d09.webm?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/48e770957f7e4084e501f8b3a4819d09.mp4?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn every corner of the stockroom. At the slightest suspicious detail, take out your phone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore in the dark<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/f1288eabd81544c871599486e381c523.poster.avif?t=1793647947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/f1288eabd81544c871599486e381c523.webm?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/f1288eabd81544c871599486e381c523.mp4?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lights aren't enough, grab your flashlight. Search every corner and sweep the shelves.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get your hands dirty<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/4bf134901575cf6e701e1809a481fb8f.poster.avif?t=1793647947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/4bf134901575cf6e701e1809a481fb8f.webm?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/4bf134901575cf6e701e1809a481fb8f.mp4?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing ever goes as planned on the night shift. You'll have to figure it out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep your flashlight charged<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/f54c82e934079379e65508d715e7ff71.poster.avif?t=1793647947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/f54c82e934079379e65508d715e7ff71.webm?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/f54c82e934079379e65508d715e7ff71.mp4?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without it, you won't see much. And beware of the outlets!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >44 anomalies to discover (sound, visual, interaction)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 ways to play, from intern to daily challenge<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected events to handle in the middle of the night<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment with what you earn<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storage Anomaly is a first-person observation game. You work the night shift, alone, in a store's stockroom. Something has changed. It's up to you to find it.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spot what's off<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/cf1e8a3cba03bf9ba03163286cf17376.poster.avif?t=1793647947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/cf1e8a3cba03bf9ba03163286cf17376.webm?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shelf moved, one box too many, a door that wasn't there before. The further you go, the stranger the stockroom gets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look closely, take a photo<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/48e770957f7e4084e501f8b3a4819d09.poster.avif?t=1793647947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/48e770957f7e4084e501f8b3a4819d09.webm?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/48e770957f7e4084e501f8b3a4819d09.mp4?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn every corner of the stockroom. At the slightest suspicious detail, take out your phone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore in the dark<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/f1288eabd81544c871599486e381c523.poster.avif?t=1793647947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/f1288eabd81544c871599486e381c523.webm?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/f1288eabd81544c871599486e381c523.mp4?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lights aren't enough, grab your flashlight. Search every corner and sweep the shelves.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get your hands dirty<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/4bf134901575cf6e701e1809a481fb8f.poster.avif?t=1793647947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/4bf134901575cf6e701e1809a481fb8f.webm?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/4bf134901575cf6e701e1809a481fb8f.mp4?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing ever goes as planned on the night shift. You'll have to figure it out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep your flashlight charged<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/f54c82e934079379e65508d715e7ff71.poster.avif?t=1793647947\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/f54c82e934079379e65508d715e7ff71.webm?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/extras\/f54c82e934079379e65508d715e7ff71.mp4?t=1793647947\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without it, you won't see much. And beware of the outlets!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >44 anomalies to discover (sound, visual, interaction)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 ways to play, from intern to daily challenge<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected events to handle in the middle of the night<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment with what you earn<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Storage Anomaly puts you in the role of a cashier assigned to identify unusual anomalies in a store's storage room. Use your phone to take photos of the anomalies, stay alert, solve puzzles, and face unexpected challenges as you navigate through a dark and creepy environment","supported_languages":"English, French, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Italian, German, Arabic, Bulgarian, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Malay, Norwegian, Dutch, Polish, Romanian, Russian, Swedish, Czech, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/68516068bb063bed33a36f4aae8b5c5a2b3b784b\/header.jpg?t=1793647947","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/ff80d2061c3c2f7bece0f2e5946fe271a13408f2\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793647947","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3206660\/ff80d2061c3c2f7bece0f2e5946fe271a13408f2\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793647947","website":"https:\/\/cinrgames.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GTX 1060<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia RTX 3060<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>